    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this all just a dream? or something more...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>It starts with waking up. It always does. What happens next can be determined by a number of variables, algorithms, conditions...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/8cf28d01d33983b7fac8d45b8f0ba0dd.avif?t=1744922389\" data-has-big width=800 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk and drive through the atmospheric world of<strong> SUBURBADROME,</strong>\u00a0a puzzle game and walking simulator with multiple endings and an intertwining story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WATCH</strong> the fuel gauge of your car. Nobody wants to be stranded in the barren wastes of a suburb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/605b7b5c8b69d4566ebe6795588103bf.avif?t=1744922389\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIPHON</strong> other vehicles for gas, but be wary of the strange side effects of siphoning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/d55f73c1fceb5280615dc6eb814641ad.avif?t=1744922389\" data-has-big width=800 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER</strong> the inner workings of the world of SUBURBADROME through accessible terminals that slowly peel back the bandaged scars.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/042a7aa2538af018c5a63c37fe22fee3.avif?t=1744922389\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
